#: includes/Admin/Page.php:575
msgid "Disconnect this site"
msgstr "Atjungti šią svetainę"

#: includes/Admin/Page.php:575
msgid "Disconnect this site from SmokyPost? Sharing stops until you sign in again."
msgstr "Atjungti šią svetainę nuo „SmokyPost“? Bendrinimas sustos, kol vėl prisijungsite."

#: includes/Admin/Page.php:577
msgid "Yes, disconnect"
msgstr "Taip, atjungti"

#: includes/Admin/Page.php:586
msgid "How Pro works"
msgstr "Kaip veikia „Pro“"

#: includes/Admin/Page.php:587
msgid "Pay securely through Paddle."
msgstr "Saugiai sumokėkite per „Paddle“."

#: includes/Admin/Page.php:588
msgid "Download SmokyPost Pro with the button below."
msgstr "Atsisiųskite „SmokyPost Pro“ mygtuku žemiau."

#: includes/Admin/Page.php:588
msgid "Come back to this page. A \"Download SmokyPost Pro\" button appears, and we e-mail you the same link."
msgstr "Grįžkite į šį puslapį. Pasirodys mygtukas „Atsisiųsti SmokyPost Pro“, o tą pačią nuorodą atsiųsime ir el. paštu."

#: includes/Admin/Page.php:589
msgid "Install it under Plugins > Add New > Upload Plugin and activate it. Your license is picked up automatically, there is no key to enter."
